## 2 · Code and examples authored by DCS AI Technologies L.L.C — MIT

All source code, scripts, configuration and example snippets written by DCS AI Technologies L.L.C
and published here are licensed under the **MIT licence**. See [`LICENSE-MIT`](LICENSE-MIT).

This matches the three public standard repositories (`r2-standard`, `r3-standard`, `r4-standard`),
each of which carries its own MIT `LICENSE`. Those repositories are **not** relicensed by this file.

## 3 · Third-party material — EXCLUDED

**No licence is granted here for any material DCS AI Technologies L.L.C did not author.**
Third-party material is excluded from both grants above unless it is separately and explicitly
licensed at the point where it appears.

This exclusion covers, without limiting its scope:

- material reproduced verbatim from another source, including the May 2026 ceremony transcript
  reproduced in [`history/`](history/), which is governed by the licence of the repository it was
  taken from and not by this file;
- any third-party specification, standard, trademark, name or logo referred to;
- any dependency, library or vendored component;
- any external evidence, report or attestation authored by a party other than
  DCS AI Technologies L.L.C.

Where such material appears, its own licence and its own attribution requirements govern. If you
cannot determine the licence of a specific file, **treat it as excluded and ask before reusing it.**

## 4 · What no licence grants

Neither licence above is a warranty, a certification, or a statement of fitness. In particular:

- **Nothing in the R-Series has been externally audited.** A permissive licence is not an assurance
  claim, and reuse under it is not evidence that anything here has been independently reviewed.
- This portal is a **skeleton under construction and is not a released claim surface**. Content is
  gated on the P0 register in [`STATUS.md`](STATUS.md). Reusing a gated or placeholder page does not
  make its content a published DCS AI Technologies L.L.C claim.
- Neither licence grants any right in the **DCS**, **DCS Labs**, **DCS AI Technologies** or
  **R-Series** names or marks beyond the attribution CC BY 4.0 requires.
